                                                                                
  ! bd is not installed                                                         
                                                                                
  bdash reads and writes everything through the bd CLI, and there is no bd on   
  PATH.                                                                         
                                                                                
  x bd           not found on PATH                                              
  - version      not run                                                        
  - JSON schema  not run                                                        
  - workspace    not run                                                        
  - snapshot     not run                                                        
                                                                                
  What to do                                                                    
  > $ brew install beads                                                        
      # Homebrew (macOS, Linux)                                                 
    $ go install github.com/gastownhall/beads/cmd/bd@latest                     
      # Go toolchain                                                            
    $ BDASH_BD=/path/to/bd bdash                                                
      # bd is installed somewhere else                                          
    Installed already? Put its directory on PATH and press r.                   
                                                                                
  same report: bdash -v                                                         
                                                                                
  q quit  r recheck now  Up/Dn pick  y copy fix                                 